# Conformance probe pack for ruling 9 of 0.56 and the gate blocks of 0.17: probe.x
# in two blocks of a selector, only the first with a range. Fixed layout, least
# significant bit first. Public. No kinds.
format  conformance-range-056-7
version 0.56.0
distribution public
source  "goat-transformers spec/engine-spec.md (synthetic probe format, no external standard)"
uses    probe
wire       bits
word_bytes 1
field   probe.y  0:0:1  uint
if      0:0:1  0
  field probe.x  0:8:8  uint  range 0 10
end
if      0:0:1  1
  field probe.x  0:8:8  uint
end
